WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.700
Saved posts feel useful — until they vanish into a pile.

00:03.700 --> 00:09.500
Unstash turns your Reddit saved-post CSV into a private action queue, right in your browser.

00:09.500 --> 00:14.100
No login. No OAuth. No upload. Your data stays with you.

00:14.100 --> 00:19.600
Pick what happens next: read it, make it, keep it, or finish it. Then export to Markdown.

00:19.600 --> 00:24.800
The CSV importer is live. Next up: a lightweight browser extension.

00:24.800 --> 00:29.000
Open source. Private by default. Ready when you are.
